      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but rest doesnt really fix the feeling. it's just a temporary pause. every time i close my eyes i just see the same faces, the same things we couldn't do anything about. it feels like we're just putting band-aids on a corpse. what's the point of even trying to fight it anymore if the outcome is always the same? it feels so futile.",
